    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY &amp; FEATURES </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Single-ending visual novel with 20 minutes till credits<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2>Strange news reaches the ears of Yuri Amakubo, the scientist behind the ExS-TIA system.<br>On a remote island in the middle of nowhere was a woman who was the spitting image of her older sister Kaede. To uncover the truth, Yuri immediately heads to the island with Souma. <br>There, they find Kaede\u2014who remembers her name, but has lost all other memories. Surprisingly, she and Yuri possess identical pendants... <br>Could this be the key to unlocking her past?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER </h2><br><strong>Yuri Amakubo</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508150/extras/2931ccbb63d20160945881ba479695cd.avif?t=1749526223\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br>The female scientist behind the ExS-TIA system.  Possesses a keen instinct.<br><br><strong>Kaede Amakubo</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508150/extras/f332be6bc6530ef41cdbcb7988113627.avif?t=1749526223\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br>Yuri\u2019s older sister. A sophisticated woman in contrast to Yuri. Her whereabouts have long been a mystery.</li></ul>",
